0,Doutai language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doutai_language,"Doutai (Taori, Tolitai) is a Lakes Plain language of Irian Jaya, Indonesia. It is spoken in Toli-Dou village, located southwest of Taiyeve town. [2]",Doutai,Lakes Plain
